WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.610
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.880 --> 01:48.000
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.060 --> 01:51.060
[Episode 21]

4
02:11.280 --> 02:11.900
Kitty.

5
02:12.610 --> 02:13.080
Kitty.

6
02:13.500 --> 02:14.100
Come here.

7
02:16.750 --> 02:17.760
Hi,

8
02:18.829 --> 02:19.620
kitty.

9
02:19.650 --> 02:21.180
You're letting me hold you?

10
02:24.300 --> 02:26.060
Oh, you have yellow eyes!

11
02:26.250 --> 02:27.110
Are you hungry?

12
02:32.500 --> 02:33.300
Let me see.

13
02:35.690 --> 02:36.500
So pretty.

14
02:37.530 --> 02:39.690
You're so comfy, you've got your eyes closed.

15
02:39.690 --> 02:40.240
Are you hungry?

16
02:40.240 --> 02:42.840
I'll take you home and get you something to eat.

17
02:44.460 --> 02:45.400
You're back.

18
02:48.860 --> 02:50.300
Come on, time to eat.

19
02:53.090 --> 02:53.960
It seems to know you

20
02:53.960 --> 02:55.630
pretty well.

21
02:56.360 --> 02:58.160
Do you come here to feed it often?

22
02:58.340 --> 02:59.000
Yeah.

23
03:00.690 --> 03:02.250
When did you two meet?

24
03:02.870 --> 03:04.150
I first saw it

25
03:04.340 --> 03:05.500
on a rainy day.

26
03:06.300 --> 03:07.960
It just showed up out of nowhere.

27
03:07.960 --> 03:09.090
What a coincidence.

28
03:09.500 --> 03:10.240
Do you remember?

29
03:10.240 --> 03:11.250
We first met

30
03:11.250 --> 03:12.400
on a rainy day, too.

31
03:16.150 --> 03:18.000
Can I take it home?

32
03:19.610 --> 03:20.260
It has been free to roam outside

33
03:20.260 --> 03:22.260
from the very beginning.

34
03:22.690 --> 03:23.460
I feel like it'd be better off

35
03:23.460 --> 03:24.460
staying out here.

36
03:25.400 --> 03:26.190
Fair enough.

37
03:27.030 --> 03:29.400
So, what's its name?

38
03:30.630 --> 03:31.430
Kitty.

39
03:33.560 --> 03:35.090
Who names a cat that?

40
03:40.500 --> 03:41.300
Then

41
03:42.430 --> 03:44.030
why don't you give her a name?

42
03:44.860 --> 03:45.650
Me?

43
03:46.930 --> 03:48.500
How

44
03:48.530 --> 03:50.430
about Rainie?

45
03:51.500 --> 03:52.360
We both met you

46
03:52.360 --> 03:53.560
on rainy days.

47
03:53.780 --> 03:56.590
♪ I look up at the sky ♪

48
03:56.000 --> 03:56.800
Rainie.

49
03:57.340 --> 03:59.990
♪ And there you are, always by my side ♪

50
03:57.930 --> 03:58.560
Rainie.

51
03:58.560 --> 03:59.300
Rainie.

52
04:00.790 --> 04:03.200
♪ Since when did it begin? ♪

53
04:01.090 --> 04:01.860
Hello, Rainie.

54
04:01.860 --> 04:02.690
I'm Shize.

55
04:03.220 --> 04:06.420
♪ I can't quite recall ♪

56
04:04.030 --> 04:05.190
I'm Lili.

57
04:07.330 --> 04:10.420
♪ You became the clouds in my dreams ♪

58
04:07.650 --> 04:09.180
She seems to really like it.

59
04:09.750 --> 04:10.960
We're leaving now, Rainie.

60
04:10.920 --> 04:13.080
♪ Silent and weightless ♪

61
04:11.300 --> 04:12.090
Bye-bye.

62
04:13.340 --> 04:16.380
♪ I wish I could stay ♪

63
04:16.940 --> 04:20.240
♪ Walking by your side forever ♪

64
04:21.950 --> 04:24.880
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

65
04:24.940 --> 04:27.100
♪ Through tides that ebb and flow ♪

66
04:28.430 --> 04:29.950
I didn't have much to do at home today,

67
04:28.790 --> 04:31.740
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

68
04:29.950 --> 04:32.240
so I did a little tidying up.

69
04:31.760 --> 04:34.050
♪ As we feel the world transform ♪

70
04:34.950 --> 04:36.450
Go change your clothes.

71
04:35.130 --> 04:38.700
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

72
04:36.450 --> 04:38.580
I've got something good for you to eat.

73
04:38.870 --> 04:41.730
♪ To meet the moon ♪

74
04:41.760 --> 04:44.690
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

75
04:44.159 --> 04:46.040
I put all your liquor away, too.

76
04:44.710 --> 04:47.600
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

77
04:47.630 --> 04:51.790
♪ I just wanna stay with you ♪

78
04:48.830 --> 04:49.760
Have some water.

79
04:52.110 --> 04:54.980
♪ That's the only thing that matters ♪

80
04:52.830 --> 04:54.290
Thanks for doing all this.

81
04:55.090 --> 04:58.830
♪ Love gives us all ♪

82
04:55.659 --> 04:56.560
It was nothing.

83
04:58.850 --> 05:01.910
♪ Like the moon lighting up every night ♪

84
04:59.159 --> 05:00.360
I'll go change, then.

85
05:01.930 --> 05:02.750
♪ You know ♪

86
05:02.770 --> 05:06.010
♪ I'm in love with you ♪

87
05:06.030 --> 05:08.840
♪ No matter how many times I say I love you ♪

88
05:08.860 --> 05:12.440
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

89
05:13.340 --> 05:18.240
♪ I could say it ten thousand times and never tire ♪

90
05:31.250 --> 05:32.540
I couldn't get to the second floor,

91
05:32.540 --> 05:33.190
but I wiped down

92
05:33.190 --> 05:34.750
the rest of the place.

93
05:39.540 --> 05:41.040
W-What's wrong?

94
05:42.390 --> 05:43.190
Nothing.

95
05:45.860 --> 05:46.630
I'm sorry.

96
05:46.630 --> 05:48.890
I-I shouldn't have taken the liberty.

97
05:50.110 --> 05:51.860
From now on,

98
05:52.750 --> 05:55.409
I'll take care of the cleaning and stuff myself.

99
05:57.360 --> 05:58.890
I need to go back home after dinner

100
05:58.890 --> 05:59.750
to pick something up.

101
05:59.750 --> 06:01.100
Then I'll come back.

102
06:01.180 --> 06:01.750
Okay.

103
06:41.540 --> 06:42.830
Look at you,

104
06:42.890 --> 06:43.659
rushing

105
06:43.659 --> 06:45.040
to give yourself to him.

106
06:45.310 --> 06:46.300
I am not.

107
06:48.930 --> 06:50.730
Then why are you packing so fast?

108
06:50.930 --> 06:53.659
You've practically emptied out your whole room.

109
06:55.159 --> 06:57.500
Well, he invited me.

110
06:57.740 --> 06:58.930
If I turned him down,

111
06:58.930 --> 07:00.060
it'd seem

112
07:00.690 --> 07:02.020
a little cold-hearted.

113
07:04.430 --> 07:05.690
Cold-hearted?

114
07:08.750 --> 07:11.360
I asked you to see a movie the week before last,

115
07:11.600 --> 07:12.460
and you said no.

116
07:12.860 --> 07:14.540
Then I invited you to hot pot last week,

117
07:14.540 --> 07:16.140
and you turned me down again.

118
07:16.760 --> 07:18.320
You've really

119
07:18.660 --> 07:20.600
broken my heart.

120
07:21.300 --> 07:23.600
I was studying for exams!

121
07:23.630 --> 07:25.190
I didn't mean it.

122
07:25.350 --> 07:27.150
All right, I'm just teasing you.

123
07:29.300 --> 07:30.300
But seriously,

124
07:30.450 --> 07:32.510
don't move all your stuff over there.

125
07:32.690 --> 07:34.560
Leave yourself a way out.

126
07:34.890 --> 07:35.600
In case you two

127
07:35.600 --> 07:36.890
get into a fight someday,

128
07:36.890 --> 07:38.550
you can always come back here.

129
07:38.560 --> 07:41.290
It's better than ending up on the streets, right?

130
07:41.630 --> 07:42.430
Exactly.

131
07:43.560 --> 07:44.500
You're the sweetest.

132
07:44.500 --> 07:46.600
You'll always be my safe haven.

133
07:47.659 --> 07:48.630
Don't be mad.

134
07:51.060 --> 07:51.390
Oh, and

135
07:51.390 --> 07:52.830
if going back to campus

136
07:53.250 --> 07:54.690
is too much trouble,

137
07:54.690 --> 07:56.250
or you're too busy one day,

138
07:56.250 --> 07:57.650
you can always stay here.

139
07:59.830 --> 08:00.950
Fu Zhengchu said

140
08:00.950 --> 08:02.130
the same thing today.

141
08:02.130 --> 08:03.360
He asked me to move in with him,

142
08:03.360 --> 08:04.500
but I turned him down.

143
08:04.500 --> 08:05.300
Why?

144
08:06.060 --> 08:07.690
Don't you like him?

145
08:08.660 --> 08:10.000
I do,

146
08:10.630 --> 08:11.890
but I feel like

147
08:12.500 --> 08:13.950
moving in together is a big step,

148
08:13.950 --> 08:15.390
and we shouldn't rush into it.

149
08:15.390 --> 08:16.250
Think about it.

150
08:16.360 --> 08:17.890
When two people are dating,

151
08:17.890 --> 08:18.640
they always want to show each other

152
08:18.640 --> 08:20.500
their best side.

153
08:20.660 --> 08:22.300
But once they live together,

154
08:22.450 --> 08:24.160
all those little flaws

155
08:24.560 --> 08:26.090
become impossible to hide.

156
08:26.240 --> 08:27.240
Little flaws?

157
08:27.930 --> 08:28.390
Yeah.

158
08:28.760 --> 08:29.900
Like,

159
08:30.100 --> 08:31.160
I might get up in the morning

160
08:31.160 --> 08:32.289
without brushing my teeth or washing my face,

161
08:32.289 --> 08:33.600
with my hair all messy

162
08:33.770 --> 08:35.100
me in sloppy clothes.

163
08:35.150 --> 08:36.340
Or I might get too loud

164
08:36.340 --> 08:37.549
when I'm gaming.

165
08:38.100 --> 08:39.860
If he saw all that,

166
08:40.280 --> 08:41.659
would he

167
08:43.250 --> 08:44.250
be disappointed?

168
08:44.940 --> 08:45.960
Would he realize

169
08:46.160 --> 08:47.460
I'm not the Tang Lin

170
08:47.460 --> 08:48.650
he imagined me to be?

171
08:49.280 --> 08:50.110
Actually,

172
08:50.280 --> 08:51.810
I have the same concerns.

173
08:52.200 --> 08:53.460
That's why

174
08:53.840 --> 08:55.430
it's a double-edged sword.

175
08:56.050 --> 08:58.180
Living together can bring you closer,

176
08:58.410 --> 08:59.280
but it also means

177
08:59.280 --> 09:01.130
seeing each other

178
09:01.440 --> 09:02.700
for who you really are,

179
09:02.890 --> 09:04.220
imperfections and all.

180
10:29.890 --> 10:32.050
We already have some at home, don't we?

181
10:34.030 --> 10:35.430
Matching toothbrushes,

182
10:35.460 --> 10:36.290
matching slippers,

183
10:36.290 --> 10:37.350
matching pajamas.

184
10:37.530 --> 10:38.860
What's wrong with that?

185
11:02.370 --> 11:03.030
Hello?

186
11:03.160 --> 11:04.010
Hey, Yun Li.

187
11:04.040 --> 11:04.690
Hello.

188
11:05.100 --> 11:06.480
My final exam results are out.

189
11:06.480 --> 11:07.810
I ranked 6th in my grade.

190
11:09.750 --> 11:10.750
S-So what?

191
11:10.940 --> 11:12.550
Don't play dumb!

192
11:12.740 --> 11:14.410
Didn't you promise me last time?

193
11:14.410 --> 11:16.170
You said if my grades improved,

194
11:16.170 --> 11:18.270
y-you'd book me a ticket to Nanwu.

195
11:18.290 --> 11:19.330
No way.

196
11:20.030 --> 11:21.000
And when did I

197
11:21.030 --> 11:22.150
ever say that?

198
11:22.150 --> 11:23.050
What I said last time

199
11:23.050 --> 11:24.630
was that I didn't have the money.

200
11:24.630 --> 11:26.220
Please, Li!

201
11:26.220 --> 11:27.630
I already made plans with Shize.

202
11:27.630 --> 11:29.270
He said I could borrow his drone.

203
11:29.270 --> 11:31.670
I might as well go pick it up while I'm there.

204
11:32.270 --> 11:34.000
You promised Yun Ye your drone?

205
11:34.740 --> 11:35.740
Book him a ticket.

206
11:35.860 --> 11:36.720
I'll pay for it.

207
11:40.030 --> 11:41.550
Who are you talking to?

208
11:41.960 --> 11:43.200
Are you with Shize?

209
11:43.750 --> 11:44.550
No, I'm not.

210
11:45.050 --> 11:45.410
Li,

211
11:45.460 --> 11:46.410
thank Shize for me.

212
11:46.410 --> 11:47.550
Tell him I love him.

213
11:47.700 --> 11:49.290
I won't interrupt your date.

214
11:49.290 --> 11:50.620
Bye! I'm hanging up now.

215
11:53.700 --> 11:55.630
You're way too indulgent with him.

216
11:56.030 --> 11:57.360
If he's someone you care about,

217
11:57.360 --> 11:58.760
I'll care about him, too.

218
12:03.430 --> 12:04.680
[Steal A Moment To Sip Wine Guesthouse]

219
12:19.340 --> 12:20.550
It's only been 4 hours.

220
12:20.550 --> 12:21.480
Miss me already?

221
12:21.820 --> 12:22.390
Get lost.

222
12:26.390 --> 12:27.200
Xia,

223
12:27.530 --> 12:28.720
d-do you think

224
12:28.860 --> 12:29.860
Fu Shize will

225
12:29.860 --> 12:31.050
mistreat our Lili?

226
12:31.780 --> 12:32.610
Don't worry.

227
12:32.630 --> 12:34.890
People tend to cherish their first love.

228
12:35.360 --> 12:36.790
First love never lasts!

229
12:36.960 --> 12:38.740
Those two have to stay together forever,

230
12:38.740 --> 12:40.700
till they're old and gray.

231
12:41.340 --> 12:42.130
Tangy,

232
12:42.340 --> 12:44.130
we should stay together forever, too,

233
12:44.130 --> 12:45.250
till we're old and gray.

234
12:45.250 --> 12:47.000
Stop being so cheesy.

235
12:57.440 --> 12:58.250
Hey, Lili.

236
12:58.370 --> 12:58.840
Tangy,

237
12:58.840 --> 13:00.040
have you moved in yet?

238
13:00.120 --> 13:00.790
Not yet.

239
13:00.980 --> 13:01.780
What's wrong?

240
13:02.700 --> 13:03.500
Nothing.

241
13:03.500 --> 13:04.500
I'll be going back to stay

242
13:04.500 --> 13:06.150
for a few days in a couple of days.

243
13:06.150 --> 13:07.610
Did you two fight already?

244
13:08.030 --> 13:08.980
Did you break up?

245
13:09.130 --> 13:10.050
No,

246
13:10.500 --> 13:11.550
my little brother is coming.

247
13:11.550 --> 13:13.550
I don't want them to find out so soon.

248
13:15.290 --> 13:18.090
So you're taking your relationship underground?

249
13:19.290 --> 13:20.030
Think about it.

250
13:20.030 --> 13:22.000
If my dad found out,

251
13:22.030 --> 13:22.890
he'd come over

252
13:22.890 --> 13:24.130
and tear me limb from limb!

253
13:24.130 --> 13:25.550
Fair point.

254
13:26.340 --> 13:27.130
Bye-bye.

255
13:34.050 --> 13:35.550
Fu Zhengchu, I'm warning you.

256
13:35.550 --> 13:36.960
Lili's little brother

257
13:36.960 --> 13:37.750
is coming in a couple of days.

258
13:37.750 --> 13:38.750
Keep your mouth shut

259
13:38.750 --> 13:39.630
when he gets here.

260
13:39.630 --> 13:41.160
Don't say anything stupid.

261
13:41.460 --> 13:42.240
Relax.

262
13:42.240 --> 13:44.460
I'm the best at keeping secrets.

263
13:47.890 --> 13:49.020
Do you believe that?

264
14:17.170 --> 14:17.790
Yun Li,

265
14:18.150 --> 14:20.210
let me pick up Yun Ye when he gets here.

266
14:20.790 --> 14:21.530
I have two movie tickets

267
14:21.530 --> 14:22.870
for Saturday night.

268
14:23.460 --> 14:25.150
Yunyi has tutoring that evening,

269
14:25.150 --> 14:26.950
so it'd be a waste not to use them.

270
14:30.100 --> 14:31.030
Then I'll ask Yun Ye

271
14:31.030 --> 14:32.150
if he wants to go.

272
14:39.930 --> 14:41.930
I've been wanting to see this movie.

273
14:42.080 --> 14:43.610
Would you like to go with me?

274
14:49.390 --> 14:50.190
What's wrong?

275
14:51.630 --> 14:54.090
Yin Yucheng asked me to go to a movie with him.

276
14:57.600 --> 14:58.410
And?

277
15:00.380 --> 15:01.840
Let me text him back first.

278
15:05.340 --> 15:05.990
Wait.

279
15:17.120 --> 15:18.080
My boyfriend isn't comfortable with me

280
15:18.080 --> 15:19.840
going out alone with another guy.

281
15:19.840 --> 15:20.860
Sorry.

282
15:24.200 --> 15:25.000
Yunyi,

283
15:25.790 --> 15:26.960
did Yun Ye really tell you

284
15:26.960 --> 15:28.760
his sister isn't seeing anyone?

285
15:28.840 --> 15:29.630
Yeah.

286
15:32.750 --> 15:33.560
Yucheng.

287
15:33.940 --> 15:35.460
Is it possible

288
15:35.890 --> 15:37.130
that Yun Ye just doesn't know

289
15:37.130 --> 15:38.930
his sister is in a relationship?

290
15:43.570 --> 15:44.230
Should I delete him

291
15:44.230 --> 15:45.540
on WeChat?

292
15:45.790 --> 15:46.170
Do it.

293
15:51.750 --> 15:52.860
But Yun Ye and his sister

294
15:52.860 --> 15:53.700
are really close.

295
15:53.700 --> 15:54.740
If I just delete him like that,

296
15:54.740 --> 15:55.530
won't I seem difficult

297
15:55.530 --> 15:56.650
to get along with?

298
15:59.030 --> 16:00.690
You're hesitating that much?

299
16:01.630 --> 16:04.430
You deleted me without a second thought back then.

300
16:06.290 --> 16:08.000
Y-You knew back then?

301
16:09.660 --> 16:11.520
Then why didn't you say anything?

302
16:18.440 --> 16:19.460
I agonized over it

303
16:20.290 --> 16:22.440
for ages before deleting you.

304
16:22.460 --> 16:23.860
I didn't want to, either.

305
16:24.980 --> 16:25.600
Really?

306
16:25.630 --> 16:26.220
Mm-hmm.

307
16:30.820 --> 16:31.700
Sorry,

308
16:31.820 --> 16:33.100
I got the wrong idea.

309
16:36.940 --> 16:38.470
At least he knows his place.

310
16:39.240 --> 16:41.440
So, should I still delete him on WeChat?

311
16:41.550 --> 16:42.360
No need.

312
16:49.500 --> 16:51.460
You said you'd fly the drone with me.

313
16:51.460 --> 16:53.750
Come fly with me after work, okay?

314
16:54.720 --> 16:55.290
Mm-hmm.

315
17:24.790 --> 17:25.589
Lili,

316
17:26.680 --> 17:27.480
did you get it?

317
17:29.880 --> 17:30.460
Yeah.

318
17:31.680 --> 17:32.940
Your signature move,

319
17:33.000 --> 17:34.070
the Cube Roll.

320
17:36.650 --> 17:37.590
That's how

321
17:38.070 --> 17:40.000
you won me over back then.

322
17:42.870 --> 17:44.140
Remember the final

323
17:44.140 --> 17:45.380
of the national competition?

324
17:45.380 --> 17:46.140
You beat your opponent

325
17:46.140 --> 17:47.140
with that move.

326
17:47.270 --> 17:48.500
The whole crowd went wild,

327
17:48.500 --> 17:50.760
and I was cheering right along with them.

328
17:54.590 --> 17:55.330
Did you

329
17:55.330 --> 17:56.860
keep competing after that?

330
18:04.480 --> 18:05.270
Shize,

331
18:06.570 --> 18:08.000
I often feel

332
18:08.680 --> 18:10.740
like you're not

333
18:10.230 --> 18:12.050
♪ A thin short line ♪

334
18:11.500 --> 18:12.740
quite the same person you used to be.

335
18:12.070 --> 18:15.690
♪ Two hearts intertwined ♪

336
18:17.420 --> 18:19.420
♪ Which way to go ♪

337
18:19.710 --> 18:22.690
♪ Might be simpler so ♪

338
18:19.940 --> 18:20.740
So...

339
18:21.500 --> 18:25.810
I just thought the old you,

340
18:24.720 --> 18:26.480
♪ Some wait for an umbrella ♪

341
18:26.500 --> 18:30.500
♪ Some wait for the sun to show ♪

342
18:26.700 --> 18:28.160
so confident and radiant,

343
18:28.500 --> 18:29.680
was amazing.

344
18:31.570 --> 18:36.870
♪ Hesitant feet—which side should I stand on ♪

345
18:35.590 --> 18:36.180
Well,

346
18:37.070 --> 18:38.830
you're amazing now, too.

347
18:39.370 --> 18:42.050
♪ The cold pale moon ♪

348
18:39.940 --> 18:41.700
I just don't know

349
18:41.980 --> 18:43.290
what you've been through.

350
18:42.070 --> 18:43.660
♪ Never touching the ground ♪

351
18:43.680 --> 18:45.480
♪ Far too out of reach ♪

352
18:45.150 --> 18:46.450
Knowing me, I'm not very good

353
18:45.510 --> 18:48.480
♪ This damp murmur ♪

354
18:46.480 --> 18:47.900
at asking questions.

355
18:48.770 --> 18:53.230
♪ Loud as it is, unheard ♪

356
18:50.290 --> 18:52.980
But it's okay if you're not ready to talk about it.

357
18:52.980 --> 18:54.070
I just feel like

358
18:53.900 --> 18:57.250
♪ Afraid it's too late ♪

359
18:55.980 --> 18:59.000
it's not right for me not to understand how you feel.

360
18:57.450 --> 19:00.440
♪ Resentment takes root inside ♪

361
19:00.970 --> 19:06.300
♪ Let debts bid farewell to unease ♪

362
19:02.900 --> 19:03.590
I want to be the person

363
19:03.590 --> 19:05.050
who understands you best.

364
19:06.490 --> 19:08.180
♪ We drift apart, each on our way ♪

365
19:08.210 --> 19:11.730
♪ Maybe someday ♪

366
19:11.750 --> 19:14.350
♪ Longing finds its way ♪

367
19:14.690 --> 19:21.400
♪ I hope you write the ending of our tale ♪

368
19:14.940 --> 19:15.900
I'm sorry, Lili.

369
19:18.200 --> 19:19.000
I...

370
19:22.400 --> 19:24.260
I'm not ready to talk about it yet.

371
19:26.960 --> 19:28.400
Can I tell you

372
19:30.240 --> 19:31.100
when I'm ready?

373
19:33.460 --> 19:34.290
It's okay.

374
19:34.740 --> 19:35.550
I'll wait.

375
19:44.530 --> 19:46.510
Nanwu is so beautiful!

376
19:46.980 --> 19:48.310
Li, no wonder you don't want

377
19:48.310 --> 19:49.310
to go back to Xifu.

378
19:49.500 --> 19:51.100
I'll go to college here, too.

379
19:51.460 --> 19:52.550
What are you talking about?

380
19:52.550 --> 19:53.850
If you and I both move to Nanwu,

381
19:53.850 --> 19:55.500
what about Dad and Mom?

382
19:55.670 --> 19:57.300
They're not kids anymore.

383
19:57.330 --> 19:59.190
They can take care of themselves.

384
19:59.810 --> 20:00.480
Shize,

385
20:00.480 --> 20:01.290
can I see

386
20:01.290 --> 20:02.420
your drone first?

387
20:02.900 --> 20:03.530
Sure.

388
20:04.050 --> 20:05.780
Let's head back to the guesthouse first.

389
20:05.780 --> 20:07.130
Shize is busy,

390
20:07.350 --> 20:08.140
and he's already

391
20:08.140 --> 20:09.590
going out of his way to pick you up today.

392
20:09.590 --> 20:10.740
I'll bring the drone

393
20:10.740 --> 20:11.980
over to you later.

394
20:12.290 --> 20:14.660
But I want to see the drone first.

395
20:14.830 --> 20:16.550
And I have so many questions to ask.

396
20:16.550 --> 20:18.050
Didn't you want to go to the beach?

397
20:18.050 --> 20:19.050
The weather's lovely.

398
20:19.050 --> 20:20.240
Why don't I take you there?

399
20:20.240 --> 20:21.900
What's so fun about the beach?

400
20:21.960 --> 20:22.700
Shize is so busy,

401
20:22.700 --> 20:24.530
and he finally has some free time.

402
20:24.530 --> 20:26.290
I want to see the drone first.

403
20:26.790 --> 20:28.160
Shize, please?

404
20:31.030 --> 20:32.090
It's still early.

405
20:32.530 --> 20:34.050
Let's take him home to see the drone first.

406
20:34.050 --> 20:35.030
Thanks, Shize.

407
20:48.520 --> 20:49.750
Take off your shoes and put on slippers.

408
20:49.750 --> 20:50.570
Don't be rude.

409
20:55.750 --> 20:58.080
It's fine. You don't have to take them off.

410
21:05.740 --> 21:06.940
Take off your jacket.

411
21:08.330 --> 21:09.000
Shize,

412
21:09.000 --> 21:10.660
your house is huge!

413
21:10.830 --> 21:11.790
Make yourself at home.

414
21:11.790 --> 21:12.270
Okay.

415
21:15.000 --> 21:16.000
Don't touch that.

416
21:16.590 --> 21:17.400
Put it back.

417
21:18.200 --> 21:19.940
Find somewhere to sit.

418
21:23.830 --> 21:25.460
Yun Ye, what would you like to drink?

419
21:25.460 --> 21:26.330
Anything's fine.

420
21:26.330 --> 21:27.190
Thanks, Shize.

421
21:30.440 --> 21:30.980
By the way,

422
21:30.980 --> 21:32.090
where's your drone?

423
21:32.090 --> 21:32.920
Can I go see it?

424
21:33.000 --> 21:34.200
It's inside the room.

425
21:34.500 --> 21:35.290
This room?

426
21:35.810 --> 21:36.350
Yun Ye.

427
21:37.830 --> 21:38.940
T-That room.

428
21:41.660 --> 21:43.290
-Which room, Li? -This one.

429
21:48.500 --> 21:50.250
This is so cool.

430
21:52.240 --> 21:54.370
I said you could look, not mess with it.

431
22:00.460 --> 22:02.990
You're dating someone and keeping it from me?

432
22:03.900 --> 22:06.250
H-How did you find out?

433
22:06.750 --> 22:08.110
How else?

434
22:08.140 --> 22:09.250
You were treating me

435
22:09.250 --> 22:11.180
like you were the lady of the house.

436
22:12.460 --> 22:13.660
Grown-up business.

437
22:13.660 --> 22:15.250
Kids should stay out of it.

438
22:17.350 --> 22:19.330
Did you spend New Year's Eve with him, too?

439
22:19.330 --> 22:20.190
So what if I did?

440
22:21.590 --> 22:22.830
Oh, Yun Li,

441
22:22.900 --> 22:23.900
you're so busted.

442
22:24.700 --> 22:26.500
Not only are you dating someone,

443
22:26.660 --> 22:28.260
you're living with him, too.

444
22:28.540 --> 22:29.190
No wonder

445
22:29.220 --> 22:30.940
you kept refusing to let me come to Nanwu.

446
22:30.940 --> 22:32.530
You've got a man and forgotten your own brother!

447
22:32.530 --> 22:33.790
Are you pointing at me?

448
22:35.090 --> 22:36.150
Give me your phone.

449
22:37.330 --> 22:37.860
What for?

450
22:40.940 --> 22:42.140
Why do you want my phone?

451
22:42.140 --> 22:43.790
Give me back my New Year's red envelope money.

452
22:43.790 --> 22:44.370
In your dreams!

453
22:44.370 --> 22:45.590
H-Hey, don't—

454
22:45.590 --> 22:46.160
Give it back!

455
22:46.160 --> 22:46.770
If you don't give it back to me,

456
22:46.770 --> 22:47.750
I'll tell Dad.

457
22:48.090 --> 22:49.290
Yun Ye, you...

458
22:49.290 --> 22:50.290
Brother-in-law!

459
22:50.420 --> 22:51.750
Brother-in-law, save me!

460
22:51.750 --> 22:52.220
You...

461
22:55.090 --> 22:55.830
Yun Ye!

462
22:59.960 --> 23:01.750
Yun Li, you're way too violent.

463
23:04.530 --> 23:05.330
Even

464
23:05.500 --> 23:07.330
my brother-in-law acts more like a lady than you do.

465
23:07.330 --> 23:08.850
You sure changed your tune fast.

466
23:08.850 --> 23:09.290
Taking

467
23:09.290 --> 23:11.350
your brother-in-law's side already?

468
23:11.350 --> 23:13.400
Come on, he's tall, handsome,

469
23:13.420 --> 23:14.510
and nice.

470
23:17.500 --> 23:18.360
What about you?

471
23:19.550 --> 23:20.750
What's wrong with me?

472
23:22.830 --> 23:24.030
What's that look for?

473
23:24.350 --> 23:25.240
But Yun Li,

474
23:26.260 --> 23:27.060
what if

475
23:27.550 --> 23:28.980
Dad finds out?

476
23:28.980 --> 23:30.310
What are you going to do?

477
23:30.330 --> 23:31.700
I'm old enough.

478
23:31.700 --> 23:33.090
to date whoever I want.

479
23:36.290 --> 23:38.460
Y-You'd better not tell him just yet.

480
23:39.350 --> 23:39.880
Okay.

481
23:44.770 --> 23:45.440
I can't let this go.

482
23:45.440 --> 23:46.140
Call them

483
23:46.140 --> 23:47.600
and tell them to come back.

484
23:48.660 --> 23:49.180
What?

485
23:49.700 --> 23:51.050
You're not gonna call?

486
23:52.000 --> 23:52.930
Fine, I'll do it.

487
24:02.150 --> 24:03.160
[Dad]

488
24:06.480 --> 24:07.380
Does Dad

489
24:07.380 --> 24:09.140
have a tracker installed on my phone or something?

490
24:09.140 --> 24:10.480
Speak of the devil!

491
24:10.900 --> 24:12.200
Li, please, please,

492
24:12.200 --> 24:12.790
please help me out this once.

493
24:12.790 --> 24:14.030
You came to Nanwu without telling Dad?

494
24:14.030 --> 24:15.000
If I'd told him,

495
24:15.000 --> 24:16.250
how would I have gotten here?

496
24:16.250 --> 24:17.140
Please, Li,

497
24:17.140 --> 24:17.700
help me out this once.

498
24:17.700 --> 24:18.530
This is your problem.

499
24:18.530 --> 24:19.550
I'm not helping you this time.

500
24:19.550 --> 24:20.850
If you won't help me,

501
24:21.160 --> 24:22.110
I'll tell Dad

502
24:22.110 --> 24:23.440
you're dating someone.

503
24:23.500 --> 24:24.240
All right, all right!

504
24:24.240 --> 24:25.460
So that's how you're gonna play it, Yun Ye?

505
24:25.460 --> 24:26.050
Fine.

506
24:26.050 --> 24:26.700
Go ahead.

507
24:26.700 --> 24:27.550
Let's go down together, then.

508
24:27.550 --> 24:28.250
If I'm going down, you're coming with me.

509
24:28.250 --> 24:29.310
Go ahead. Tell him!

510
24:29.530 --> 24:31.310
Li, please, Li.

511
24:31.310 --> 24:31.940
Come on, we're

512
24:31.940 --> 24:33.640
in this together now.

513
24:34.180 --> 24:34.660
Look,

514
24:34.980 --> 24:35.510
you can't just throw me overboard

515
24:35.510 --> 24:36.940
to feed the sharks!

516
24:37.640 --> 24:38.900
Look, I'm still young.

517
24:39.090 --> 24:40.530
I've got a whole workbook of wrong answers to take care of,

518
24:40.530 --> 24:42.100
not to mention a virtual pet to feed.

519
24:42.100 --> 24:43.900
Please, please, please!

520
24:46.110 --> 24:47.330
Yun Ye, where have you been?

521
24:47.330 --> 24:49.330
Why did it take you so long to answer?

522
24:49.850 --> 24:50.460
Hello?

523
24:50.610 --> 24:51.330
Yun Li?

524
24:52.360 --> 24:52.900
Were you the one

525
24:52.900 --> 24:54.180
who bought him a plane ticket to Nanwu?

526
24:54.180 --> 24:56.090
So he went there to see you.

527
24:56.480 --> 24:58.010
It's bad enough that you went to Nanwu on your own,

528
24:58.010 --> 24:59.180
but now you've got your brother coming to join you?

529
24:59.180 --> 25:00.920
What kind of sister are you?

530
25:01.010 --> 25:02.830
He's on break, so he's just coming to stay with me for a few days.

531
25:02.830 --> 25:04.290
I'll take good care of him.

532
25:04.290 --> 25:06.220
He just got placed in the top class,

533
25:06.550 --> 25:08.290
and he's about to start his final year of high school.

534
25:08.290 --> 25:08.900
Do you have any idea how crucial

535
25:08.900 --> 25:10.590
this time is for him?

536
25:10.730 --> 25:11.710
He's got no time to go out

537
25:11.710 --> 25:12.570
and have fun!

538
25:12.660 --> 25:13.200
Tell him to get his butt back

539
25:13.200 --> 25:14.220
here today!

540
25:14.740 --> 25:15.640
My suitcase

541
25:15.640 --> 25:17.100
is full of exam prep books.

542
25:17.500 --> 25:18.810
I'm only staying for a few days.

543
25:18.810 --> 25:19.460
Mom,

544
25:19.490 --> 25:20.490
talk to Dad for me.

545
25:20.940 --> 25:22.330
Otherwise, I'm not going back either.

546
25:22.330 --> 25:22.740
Oh, so now

547
25:22.740 --> 25:23.550
that you've gotten yourself into trouble,

548
25:23.550 --> 25:24.740
you go running to someone for backup?

549
25:24.740 --> 25:25.810
It's not gonna work!

550
25:25.810 --> 25:26.420
Tell me,

551
25:26.570 --> 25:27.030
did you learn this

552
25:27.030 --> 25:28.000
from your sister?

553
25:28.000 --> 25:32.600
Going behind my back and doing whatever you want first, then telling me afterward!

554
25:33.200 --> 25:34.000
Lili,

555
25:34.380 --> 25:36.170
your brother's never been to Nanwu before.

556
25:36.170 --> 25:37.080
It's good for him to go and have some fun

557
25:37.080 --> 25:38.130
for a few days.

558
25:38.190 --> 25:39.390
Take good care of him.

559
25:40.530 --> 25:41.330
Yun Ye,

560
25:41.460 --> 25:43.790
listen to your sister while you're there,

561
25:43.820 --> 25:44.600
and have fun.

562
25:44.630 --> 25:45.530
You two can come back together

563
25:45.530 --> 25:46.660
before the New Year.

564
25:48.850 --> 25:50.510
I-I wasn't finished!

565
25:50.510 --> 25:51.510
Why'd you hang up?

566
25:52.680 --> 25:55.160
Did Mom really manage to talk Dad around?

567
25:55.720 --> 25:56.530
No idea.

568
25:57.680 --> 25:58.440
Whatever.

569
25:58.440 --> 26:00.140
At least we got through today.

570
26:00.720 --> 26:02.180
But with Dad's hair-trigger temper,

571
26:02.180 --> 26:03.580
this can't go on forever.

572
26:04.880 --> 26:05.940
I can already see

573
26:05.940 --> 26:06.810
my future.

574
26:08.110 --> 26:09.770
Am I gonna end up just like you?

575
26:10.070 --> 26:11.180
I'm warning you.

576
26:11.220 --> 26:12.270
Watch yourself.

577
26:13.240 --> 26:13.980
When you get back,

578
26:13.980 --> 26:15.110
focus on your studies

579
26:15.110 --> 26:16.510
and don't make Dad angry.

580
26:16.740 --> 26:17.740
Otherwise, he'll cut you off

581
26:17.740 --> 26:18.870
financially again.

582
26:19.640 --> 26:21.030
You're one to talk.

583
26:22.440 --> 26:23.240
If Dad finds out

584
26:23.240 --> 26:24.840
you're dating a guy in Nanwu,

585
26:25.010 --> 26:26.240
he might even fly here

586
26:26.240 --> 26:27.330
to break your legs.

587
26:30.640 --> 26:31.980
Li, how much are you making these days

588
26:31.980 --> 26:33.510
from your content creation

589
26:33.510 --> 26:35.200
and internship?

590
26:35.200 --> 26:36.000
Why do you ask?

591
26:36.610 --> 26:37.940
You should save up more.

592
26:38.010 --> 26:39.270
If Dad finds out,

593
26:39.270 --> 26:40.640
he'll kick you out.

594
26:41.640 --> 26:42.480
Would you stop

595
26:42.480 --> 26:43.510
giving me

596
26:43.510 --> 26:44.640
ridiculous advice?

597
26:47.940 --> 26:48.870
Have some fruit.

598
26:49.000 --> 26:49.460
Okay.

599
26:49.460 --> 26:50.190
You two chat.

600
26:50.240 --> 26:51.570
I'll go have some fruit.

601
26:52.640 --> 26:54.140
There's more on the dining table.

602
26:54.140 --> 26:55.670
Okay, thanks, bro-in-law.

603
26:58.400 --> 26:59.400
"Bro-in-law"?

604
27:00.420 --> 27:02.150
What are you two talking about?

605
27:02.900 --> 27:04.940
You heard all that?

606
27:06.100 --> 27:07.600
Heard what?

607
27:14.940 --> 27:15.770
Fu Shize,

608
27:17.620 --> 27:19.420
I haven't told my family

609
27:19.920 --> 27:21.810
about us dating.

610
27:23.240 --> 27:24.980
My dad has a bad temper

611
27:25.520 --> 27:27.050
and is really controlling.

612
27:27.510 --> 27:28.830
You might want

613
27:28.830 --> 27:30.490
to prepare yourself for that.

614
27:32.880 --> 27:33.480
M-My dad

615
27:33.480 --> 27:35.140
is pretty great in other ways.

616
27:35.530 --> 27:37.060
He just doesn't really know

617
27:37.680 --> 27:39.640
how to love his own kids.

618
27:45.640 --> 27:46.070
I'm not

619
27:46.070 --> 27:47.330
dating your dad.

620
27:52.240 --> 27:53.640
Do you want me to meet him?

621
27:54.310 --> 27:55.110
No...

622
27:56.720 --> 27:58.720
I just wanted to give you a heads-up.

623
27:59.740 --> 28:00.640
My dad's

624
28:01.070 --> 28:02.270
really controlling,

625
28:02.440 --> 28:04.440
and I can't win an argument with him.

626
28:05.440 --> 28:07.940
And about my family...

627
28:08.510 --> 28:10.740
My parents only graduated from vocational school.

628
28:10.740 --> 28:12.880
I'm still just an intern,

629
28:13.330 --> 28:15.140
but I can support myself now.

630
28:15.330 --> 28:16.230
Things will be even better

631
28:16.230 --> 28:18.430
once I graduate and get a full-time job.

632
28:25.880 --> 28:26.640
Lili,

633
28:27.880 --> 28:28.750
all I care about

634
28:28.750 --> 28:30.350
is the kind of person you are.

635
28:31.220 --> 28:32.240
We'll face

636
28:33.420 --> 28:35.280
whatever comes our way together.

637
28:36.510 --> 28:37.380
Nothing else

638
28:38.380 --> 28:39.180
matters.

639
28:57.680 --> 28:58.420
Yunyi.

640
29:00.460 --> 29:02.260
Have you been waiting here long?

641
29:06.830 --> 29:08.030
Where's your sister?

642
29:09.140 --> 29:10.680
She dropped me off nearby with Shize,

643
29:10.680 --> 29:11.480
then left.

644
29:12.510 --> 29:13.510
What about your brother?

645
29:13.510 --> 29:14.570
He went home too.

646
29:15.640 --> 29:17.380
Your brother knows what's up.

647
29:19.010 --> 29:19.810
What?

648
29:20.830 --> 29:21.640
Nothing.

649
29:23.610 --> 29:24.610
I think my brother

650
29:25.110 --> 29:27.510
was just worried things would get awkward.

651
29:30.900 --> 29:32.830
The view from up here is beautiful.

652
29:34.510 --> 29:35.660
Can you tell me

653
29:35.660 --> 29:36.860
your zodiac sign now?

654
29:36.880 --> 29:38.480
Find it on the star chart.

655
29:38.810 --> 29:40.610
It's right next to Sagittarius.

656
29:41.570 --> 29:42.380
Okay.

657
29:43.310 --> 29:44.270
Sagittarius...

658
29:50.030 --> 29:51.630
He's holding a bow and arrow.

659
29:52.080 --> 29:53.610
The direction his arrow points

660
29:53.610 --> 29:55.070
is where my zodiac sign is.

661
29:55.090 --> 29:56.350
Let's see...

662
29:59.830 --> 30:00.770
Scorpio!

663
30:22.610 --> 30:23.640
By the way, Yun Ye,

664
30:24.010 --> 30:26.140
there's something I wanted to ask you.

665
30:27.610 --> 30:30.030
I think those postcards

666
30:30.030 --> 30:32.010
my classmates wrote me

667
30:32.270 --> 30:34.130
were all in the same handwriting,

668
30:34.420 --> 30:36.680
but I couldn't tell whose it was.

669
30:37.070 --> 30:38.030
Do you know?

670
30:40.500 --> 30:42.550
I'll go ask around your class

671
30:42.550 --> 30:43.500
for you.

672
30:44.720 --> 30:45.330
Okay.

673
30:52.680 --> 30:53.900
I have a gift for you.

674
30:54.010 --> 30:54.940
Thanks.

675
30:56.910 --> 30:59.110
[To: Yun Ye] [From: Class 15 of Grade 11]

676
31:00.440 --> 31:01.920
Open it when you get back.

677
31:03.030 --> 31:03.530
Okay.

678
31:13.570 --> 31:15.570
What did you rank in the final exams?

679
31:16.510 --> 31:17.810
Sixth in the grade.

680
31:18.010 --> 31:18.870
What about you?

681
31:19.220 --> 31:20.380
Tenth in the grade.

682
31:23.610 --> 31:25.900
I really feel bad for your classmates.

683
31:26.430 --> 31:28.020
You're not even taking the national college entrance exam,

684
31:28.020 --> 31:29.880
and you're still so competitive.

685
31:30.010 --> 31:33.240
Who says I'm not taking the national college entrance exam?

686
31:33.240 --> 31:35.100
Aren't you going abroad to study?

687
31:35.530 --> 31:36.660
I've made up my mind.

688
31:36.830 --> 31:38.030
I'm staying in China.

689
31:38.880 --> 31:39.680
Why?

690
31:41.070 --> 31:43.070
I guess I don't really like

691
31:43.070 --> 31:45.000
the environment abroad that much.

692
31:48.970 --> 31:50.830
Are you worried you won't adjust?

693
31:51.640 --> 31:54.380
Phones and delivery services

694
31:55.240 --> 31:56.570
are so advanced these days.

695
31:56.570 --> 31:57.640
It's really convenient.

696
31:57.640 --> 31:58.510
You can still

697
31:58.510 --> 32:00.040
get Chinese food overseas.

698
32:00.220 --> 32:01.220
You can make

699
32:01.610 --> 32:03.410
plenty of Chinese friends, too,

700
32:03.640 --> 32:06.170
and even watch the Spring Festival Gala live.

701
32:06.740 --> 32:07.930
But

702
32:08.310 --> 32:09.640
they don't have...

703
32:11.380 --> 32:12.330
Don't have what?

704
32:15.540 --> 32:18.270
Are you worried they don't have QR code payments?

705
32:23.160 --> 32:24.750
No, that's not it.

706
32:27.180 --> 32:29.180
Then what do we have here

707
32:29.770 --> 32:31.570
that they don't have over there?

708
32:32.770 --> 32:34.240
You're so dense.

709
32:39.810 --> 32:41.290
If you're not going abroad,

710
32:41.290 --> 32:43.020
won't your brother be furious?

711
32:43.030 --> 32:44.640
I'm grown up now.

712
32:45.010 --> 32:47.210
I've always done what my family wanted.

713
32:47.440 --> 32:50.240
This time, I want to be brave and make my own choice.

714
32:51.460 --> 32:52.500
I'm with you!

715
32:54.380 --> 32:55.640
Which university do you want to apply to?

716
32:55.640 --> 32:57.170
I can help you figure it out.

717
32:57.940 --> 32:59.610
I really like Xifu.

718
33:00.270 --> 33:01.510
I want to go to XUST.

719
33:02.920 --> 33:04.320
XUST is a great university!

720
33:04.320 --> 33:05.590
I like XUST, too.

721
33:22.340 --> 33:25.200
[Steal A Moment To Sip Wine Guesthouse]

722
33:26.940 --> 33:28.010
Why's it so quiet today?

723
33:28.010 --> 33:29.420
Did everyone go on dates?

724
33:30.310 --> 33:32.790
Even the flies are flying off in pairs.

725
33:38.390 --> 33:39.650
Since it's so quiet today,

726
33:39.650 --> 33:41.310
let's go out and have some fun.

727
33:41.750 --> 33:42.360
A movie?

728
33:45.980 --> 33:46.590
KTV?

729
33:47.380 --> 33:48.180
Boring.

730
33:48.510 --> 33:49.830
Got any other ideas?

731
33:52.310 --> 33:53.570
How about ice skating?

732
33:54.610 --> 33:55.510
How's that any different

733
33:55.510 --> 33:56.930
from your usual skateboarding?

734
33:56.930 --> 33:58.340
Am I just gonna sit there

735
33:58.370 --> 33:59.960
and watch you show off?

736
34:02.400 --> 34:04.270
Good point.

737
34:08.480 --> 34:09.920
How about camping?

738
34:09.980 --> 34:11.010
We could fish,

739
34:11.010 --> 34:13.110
and if we catch anything, I could grill it for you.

740
34:13.110 --> 34:14.610
Then you can see

741
34:14.610 --> 34:16.340
what Chef Fu can do on the grill.

742
34:16.440 --> 34:17.230
Camping?

743
34:18.010 --> 34:18.980
We'd have to stay overnight?

744
34:18.980 --> 34:20.420
Of course. Going there and coming back

745
34:20.420 --> 34:21.280
the same day would be so boring.

746
34:21.280 --> 34:23.170
That'd defeat the whole point of camping.

747
34:23.170 --> 34:24.420
In one tent?

748
34:26.030 --> 34:26.840
No way.

749
34:28.739 --> 34:29.570
Why not?

750
34:29.940 --> 34:32.739
I don't want to give you a chance to make a move on me.

751
34:34.320 --> 34:36.630
How is that making a move on you?

752
34:36.630 --> 34:37.380
Look,

753
34:37.380 --> 34:38.840
camping out in the wilderness can be dangerous.

754
34:38.840 --> 34:39.340
We'd have to share a tent

755
34:39.340 --> 34:40.570
for me to keep you safe

756
34:40.570 --> 34:42.070
out there.

757
34:45.920 --> 34:47.710
So what do you say we do instead?

758
34:53.170 --> 34:54.980
Why are you looking at me like that?

759
34:54.980 --> 34:56.440
You're making me nervous.

760
35:02.500 --> 35:03.050
So what did she give you

761
35:03.050 --> 35:04.300
in the end?

762
35:05.070 --> 35:05.880
I don't know.

763
35:06.570 --> 35:09.010
But I wanna wait until I'm back in Xifu to open it.

764
35:09.010 --> 35:10.870
It'll feel more special that way.

765
35:11.320 --> 35:12.400
But listen,

766
35:13.950 --> 35:15.910
the wrapping on her gift

767
35:15.960 --> 35:18.490
was exactly the same as the one I used for hers.

768
35:19.610 --> 35:20.740
So you finally admit

769
35:21.320 --> 35:22.110
it wasn't the whole class

770
35:22.110 --> 35:24.110
who made those postcards together?

771
35:24.930 --> 35:25.870
Look at you,

772
35:25.900 --> 35:27.110
all smug and pleased with yourself!

773
35:27.110 --> 35:28.310
Tone it down a little.

774
35:28.660 --> 35:30.640
There's something else I wanna tell you.

775
35:30.640 --> 35:32.180
Yunyi knows

776
35:32.210 --> 35:34.610
I was the one who wrote all those postcards.

777
35:36.530 --> 35:37.920
You know what that means?

778
35:37.920 --> 35:39.260
She didn't stop me.

779
35:39.880 --> 35:41.010
She didn't stop you?

780
35:42.570 --> 35:44.280
You're really getting in

781
35:44.280 --> 35:45.630
one last daydream before nightfall.

782
35:45.630 --> 35:47.630
What do you mean, before nightfall?

783
35:47.840 --> 35:49.280
What's wrong with dreaming at night?

784
35:49.280 --> 35:51.070
Because then it's just a dream, not a daydream.

785
35:51.070 --> 35:52.510
Look at you, getting all worked up!

786
35:52.510 --> 35:53.320
Did I hit a nerve?

787
35:53.320 --> 35:53.880
What nerve? You trying to get under my skin?

788
35:53.880 --> 35:54.960
-Someone's jealous! -What's wrong with daytime, huh?

789
35:54.960 --> 35:55.610
You and your—

790
35:55.610 --> 35:56.230
You're definitely triggered.

791
35:56.230 --> 35:57.420
Don't smash my eggs!

792
35:58.500 --> 35:59.260
You keep picking up these phrases

793
35:59.260 --> 36:00.510
and using them on your own sister.

794
36:00.510 --> 36:01.980
Wait, it's just the two of us today?

795
36:01.980 --> 36:04.310
Shize is browsing the fresh food section.

796
36:04.380 --> 36:05.130
I didn't even tell him

797
36:05.130 --> 36:05.880
we were here.

798
36:05.880 --> 36:06.810
Here, take this.

799
36:06.940 --> 36:07.600
I'll get it.

800
36:11.160 --> 36:12.890
Why is it all Shanghai bok choy?

801
36:16.670 --> 36:17.480
Hello?

802
36:18.010 --> 36:19.340
Where are you now?

803
36:20.020 --> 36:22.210
I'm in the produce section.

804
36:23.760 --> 36:24.940
I'll be over in a bit.

805
36:25.320 --> 36:25.840
Okay.

806
36:28.110 --> 36:28.610
Bye-bye.

807
36:28.610 --> 36:30.210
"Where are you now?"

808
36:30.210 --> 36:31.480
"I'm in the produce section.

809
36:31.480 --> 36:32.650
I'll be over in a bit.

810
36:32.650 --> 36:33.460
Bye-bye."

811
36:33.710 --> 36:35.920
Yun Li, can you use a normal tone of voice?

812
36:35.920 --> 36:37.070
I wasn't talking to you.

813
36:37.070 --> 36:37.780
If you don't like it,

814
36:37.780 --> 36:38.840
go somewhere else.

815
36:39.070 --> 36:41.130
Putting you man before your brother!

816
36:41.260 --> 36:42.860
Since you've got my brother-in-law to shop with,

817
36:42.860 --> 36:44.260
I'm off to buy some chips.

818
36:44.320 --> 36:44.980
Bye-bye.

819
36:45.110 --> 36:46.340
Why are you in such a hurry?

820
36:46.340 --> 36:47.560
Let's go together in a bit.

821
36:47.560 --> 36:48.220
Better not.

822
36:48.510 --> 36:50.230
I need to save room before dinner.

823
36:50.230 --> 36:52.960
I don't want to fill up on your lovey-dovey stuff.

824
36:53.210 --> 36:54.170
Don't wander off.

825
36:54.170 --> 36:55.300
We're leaving soon.

826
36:55.710 --> 36:56.710
Okay.

827
37:06.720 --> 37:07.800
Here, the meat's ready.

828
37:07.800 --> 37:09.730
I've still got some left in my bowl.

829
37:15.180 --> 37:16.710
Don't just stare at your phone.

830
37:16.710 --> 37:17.510
Eat.

831
37:27.650 --> 37:29.850
Li, you did that on purpose, didn't you?

832
37:30.840 --> 37:33.510
Well, that's what you get for not eating properly.

833
37:33.510 --> 37:35.710
What have you been looking at all night?

834
37:36.510 --> 37:37.840
Zodiac compatibility?

835
37:41.320 --> 37:42.170
Did you know

836
37:42.900 --> 37:44.650
Scorpio and Cancer

837
37:44.670 --> 37:46.130
are a match made in heaven?

838
37:46.230 --> 37:47.170
Since when did you

839
37:47.170 --> 37:48.300
get into astrology?

840
37:48.840 --> 37:49.460
I'm telling you,

841
37:49.460 --> 37:51.230
kids shouldn't be looking at this stuff so much.

842
37:51.230 --> 37:52.620
You just don't get it.

843
37:52.880 --> 37:54.420
This is astronomy.

844
37:55.000 --> 37:55.520
Li,

845
37:55.900 --> 37:57.500
do you know what signs we are?

846
37:58.380 --> 37:59.170
Us?

847
37:59.510 --> 38:00.610
Do I really need to check?

848
38:00.610 --> 38:01.170
I've had you under my thumb

849
38:01.170 --> 38:02.530
your whole life.

850
38:04.010 --> 38:04.570
You...

851
38:05.440 --> 38:06.230
Um,

852
38:07.070 --> 38:08.870
what about Pisces and Aquarius?

853
38:08.880 --> 38:09.630
Pisces...

854
38:12.230 --> 38:12.780
Shize,

855
38:13.050 --> 38:15.110
y-you believe in zodiac signs too?

856
38:20.010 --> 38:21.870
I just wanna know more about them.

857
38:23.420 --> 38:24.480
Let me check.

858
38:25.790 --> 38:27.830
Pisces and Aquarius...

859
38:36.530 --> 38:38.110
T-This kind of app

860
38:38.110 --> 38:39.530
is all nonsense.

861
38:39.530 --> 38:41.320
They just make stuff up to get people to download them.

862
38:41.320 --> 38:43.180
D-Don't bother checking, Yun Ye.

863
38:43.610 --> 38:44.670
It's just for fun.

864
38:47.570 --> 38:49.100
Your birthday's coming up.

865
38:49.630 --> 38:52.030
His birthday falls on Lunar New Year's Eve.

866
38:53.770 --> 38:55.980
Wow, Shize, you were born with fireworks going off!

867
38:55.980 --> 38:57.580
No wonder you're such a star.

868
38:57.730 --> 38:58.690
Well, happy birthday

869
38:58.690 --> 38:59.650
in advance.

870
39:00.190 --> 39:00.840
Thanks.

871
39:06.140 --> 39:07.630
But since it's Lunar New Year's Eve,

872
39:07.630 --> 39:09.010
my sister can only

873
39:09.010 --> 39:11.340
wish you a happy birthday in advance, too.

874
39:14.920 --> 39:15.710
It's okay.

875
39:16.320 --> 39:18.380
Being with family is more important.

876
39:18.780 --> 39:20.220
Li, have you

877
39:20.250 --> 39:21.380
booked your ticket yet?

878
39:21.380 --> 39:22.420
Not yet.

879
39:23.000 --> 39:24.860
Then... then let me check for you.

880
39:26.340 --> 39:28.050
Maybe I should...

881
39:28.080 --> 39:29.380
I think you should go home after all.

882
39:29.380 --> 39:31.130
It's been so long since you've been back.

883
39:31.130 --> 39:33.590
You should spend more time with your family.

884
39:39.360 --> 39:40.010
Li,

885
39:40.280 --> 39:42.210
you need to look for tickets early.

886
39:42.420 --> 39:43.590
It's almost Chinese New Year,

887
39:43.590 --> 39:45.720
and everyone's trying to get tickets.

888
39:51.570 --> 39:52.630
This one's cooked.

889
39:54.440 --> 39:55.970
They're all cooked, right?

890
40:10.460 --> 40:12.660
Who goes hiking on Lunar New Year's Eve?

891
40:16.570 --> 40:17.900
I can't do this anymore.

892
40:18.320 --> 40:19.780
I can't take another step!

893
40:20.940 --> 40:21.670
You look

894
40:21.670 --> 40:22.670
so big and strong,

895
40:22.670 --> 40:24.130
but you're so out of shape.

896
40:24.550 --> 40:26.100
What a wimp!

897
40:26.320 --> 40:27.180
Come on, ma'am.

898
40:28.130 --> 40:30.030
Skateboarding takes skill,

899
40:30.570 --> 40:32.030
not that much stamina.

900
40:32.130 --> 40:33.530
What did you just call me?

901
40:33.630 --> 40:35.030
You looking for trouble?

902
40:35.110 --> 40:36.620
I-I said miss.

903
40:36.980 --> 40:38.040
You heard me wrong.

904
40:38.340 --> 40:39.670
That's not what I meant.

905
40:41.770 --> 40:43.360
Can you even make it or not?

906
40:46.670 --> 40:47.550
Let's go!

907
40:52.880 --> 40:54.080
I can't do it anymore.

908
40:54.610 --> 40:55.610
I really can't!

909
40:57.440 --> 40:58.730
There's ice-cold cola

910
40:58.730 --> 41:00.070
and grilled sausages waiting for you at the top.

911
41:00.070 --> 41:01.090
Keep pushing!

912
41:01.090 --> 41:02.280
Have mercy on me.

913
41:18.010 --> 41:18.510
I had no idea Nanwu

914
41:18.510 --> 41:19.970
had such a beautiful spot!

915
41:22.380 --> 41:24.310
There's a lot you haven't seen yet.

916
41:24.340 --> 41:25.600
When we get the chance,

917
41:25.940 --> 41:27.340
I'll show you all of them.

918
42:20.530 --> 42:21.150
Didn't you say

919
42:21.150 --> 42:22.190
all this stuff was fake?

920
42:22.190 --> 42:23.230
Why are you still checking?

921
42:23.230 --> 42:23.980
I'm bored.

922
42:23.980 --> 42:25.510
I-I'm just doing it for fun.

923
42:25.530 --> 42:26.340
Yun Li,

924
42:26.800 --> 42:29.200
I get the feeling something's on your mind.

925
42:29.940 --> 42:30.730
I'm fine.

926
42:35.280 --> 42:36.000
Why are you just standing there?

927
42:36.000 --> 42:37.400
Give me a hand!

928
42:39.290 --> 42:40.340
What are you looking at?

929
42:40.340 --> 42:42.800
I'm messaging YY.

930
42:44.130 --> 42:45.080
Who's YY?

931
42:45.740 --> 42:47.260
Have you met another girl?

932
42:49.260 --> 42:50.170
No!

933
42:50.200 --> 42:51.430
It's Yin Yunyi.

934
42:51.460 --> 42:52.210
YY

935
42:52.210 --> 42:53.840
are her initials.

936
42:56.380 --> 42:57.780
What are you sending her?

937
42:57.800 --> 42:58.590
Just a "1."

938
43:01.330 --> 43:04.100
I'm worried her parents might check her phone,

939
43:04.210 --> 43:06.300
so I send her a "1" in the morning and another at night

940
43:06.300 --> 43:08.830
as a way of saying good morning and good night.

941
43:10.980 --> 43:12.380
You're something else.

942
43:12.570 --> 43:13.110
Then

943
43:13.480 --> 43:15.480
why does it take you so long just to send a "1"?

944
43:15.480 --> 43:17.050
It's Chinese New Year today,

945
43:17.050 --> 43:18.420
so I sent one extra "1."

946
43:23.230 --> 43:24.000
Yun Ye,

947
43:24.020 --> 43:25.600
c-can I ask you something?

948
43:26.840 --> 43:29.070
When you're with Yunyi,

949
43:29.670 --> 43:31.130
do you ever feel inferior?

950
43:32.400 --> 43:33.300
Inferior?

951
43:33.400 --> 43:35.200
She's so much prettier than you.

952
43:35.630 --> 43:36.440
Yun Li,

953
43:37.000 --> 43:38.670
I am so handsome.

954
43:38.690 --> 43:41.290
How could I possibly not be good enough for her?

955
43:46.090 --> 43:47.830
What's wrong?

956
43:48.190 --> 43:50.520
I want to celebrate his birthday with him.

957
43:51.090 --> 43:52.340
It's his first birthday since we got together,

958
43:52.340 --> 43:53.380
after all.

959
43:54.600 --> 43:56.380
Isn't it because of Chinese New Year?

960
43:56.380 --> 43:57.590
We could've celebrated early,

961
43:57.590 --> 43:59.690
or even on his actual birthday.

962
44:00.380 --> 44:01.980
But he just assumed

963
44:02.130 --> 44:03.070
I'd come home.

964
44:03.070 --> 44:04.840
He didn't even try to get me to stay.

965
44:04.840 --> 44:06.900
I guess I was a little disappointed.

966
44:08.360 --> 44:09.690
Don't overthink it.

967
44:09.800 --> 44:10.570
Some people

968
44:10.570 --> 44:11.300
stop caring about birthdays

969
44:11.300 --> 44:12.400
once they're adults.

970
44:12.400 --> 44:14.230
After all, it means they're a year older.

971
44:14.230 --> 44:15.570
Maybe he's just like that

972
44:15.570 --> 44:17.300
and doesn't want to celebrate.

973
44:19.050 --> 44:19.880
I don't know.

974
44:20.670 --> 44:23.280
I just feel like there's so much distance between us.

975
44:23.280 --> 44:25.610
There are so many things he hasn't told me.

976
44:25.900 --> 44:27.820
Then ask him.

977
44:27.880 --> 44:29.050
I did.

978
44:30.530 --> 44:32.070
I just don't know what to say to him.

979
44:32.070 --> 44:33.090
I might be developing

980
44:33.090 --> 44:34.480
learned helplessness.

981
44:35.230 --> 44:36.480
No way...

982
44:39.030 --> 44:39.670
Yun Li.

983
44:40.650 --> 44:42.460
Don't act all tough at home,

984
44:42.730 --> 44:44.230
then let people walk all over you out there.

985
44:44.230 --> 44:45.400
If you keep acting like this,

986
44:45.400 --> 44:46.980
I'm gonna have to take Dad's side.

987
44:46.980 --> 44:47.780
You hear me?

988
44:51.030 --> 44:51.800
Put these away.
